Terminals unused in grammar

    INTEGER


Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: CLASS IDENTIFIER LBRACE DeclList RBRACE

    2 DeclList: DeclList MethodDecl
    3         | DeclList FieldDecl
    4         | DeclList SEMICOLON
    5         | ε

    6 MethodDecl: PUBLIC STATIC MethodHeader MethodBody

    7 FieldDecl: PUBLIC STATIC Type IdentList SEMICOLON
    8          | error SEMICOLON

    9 IdentList: IdentList COMMA IDENTIFIER
   10          | IDENTIFIER

   11 IdentListVar: IdentListVar COMMA IDENTIFIER
   12             | IDENTIFIER

   13 Type: BOOL
   14     | INT
   15     | DOUBLE

   16 MethodHeader: Type IDENTIFIER LPAR FormalParamOpt RPAR
   17             | VOID IDENTIFIER LPAR FormalParamOpt RPAR

   18 FormalParamOpt: FormalParams
   19               | ε

   20 FormalParams: Type IDENTIFIER
   21             | FormalParams COMMA Type IDENTIFIER
   22             | STRING LSQ RSQ IDENTIFIER

   23 MethodBody: LBRACE StmtOrVarList RBRACE

   24 StmtOrVarList: StmtOrVarList Statement
   25              | StmtOrVarList VarDecl
   26              | ε

   27 VarDecl: Type IdentListVar SEMICOLON

   28 Statement: LBRACE StmtList RBRACE
   29          | IfStmt
   30          | WHILE LPAR Expr RPAR Statement
   31          | RETURN ExprOpt SEMICOLON
   32          | ExprStmt SEMICOLON
   33          | PRINT LPAR Expr RPAR SEMICOLON
   34          | PRINT LPAR STRLIT RPAR SEMICOLON
   35          | error SEMICOLON

   36 StmtList: StmtList Statement
   37         | ε

   38 IfStmt: IF LPAR Expr RPAR MatchedStmt ELSE Statement
   39       | IF LPAR Expr RPAR Statement

   40 MatchedStmt: LBRACE StmtList RBRACE
   41            | IF LPAR Expr RPAR MatchedStmt ELSE MatchedStmt
   42            | WHILE LPAR Expr RPAR MatchedStmt
   43            | RETURN ExprOpt SEMICOLON
   44            | ExprStmt SEMICOLON
   45            | PRINT LPAR Expr RPAR SEMICOLON
   46            | PRINT LPAR STRLIT RPAR SEMICOLON

   47 ExprOpt: Expr
   48        | ε

   49 ExprStmt: IDENTIFIER LPAR ArgListOpt RPAR
   50         | IDENTIFIER LPAR error RPAR
   51         | IDENTIFIER ASSIGN Expr
   52         | PARSEINT LPAR IDENTIFIER LSQ Expr RSQ RPAR
   53         | PARSEINT LPAR error RPAR

   54 Expr: AssignExpr
   55     | LPAR error RPAR

   56 AssignExpr: IDENTIFIER ASSIGN AssignExpr
   57           | OrExpr

   58 OrExpr: OrExpr OR AndExpr
   59       | AndExpr

   60 AndExpr: AndExpr AND XorExpr
   61        | XorExpr

   62 XorExpr: XorExpr XOR EqExpr
   63        | EqExpr

   64 EqExpr: EqExpr EQ RelExpr
   65       | EqExpr NE RelExpr
   66       | RelExpr

   67 RelExpr: RelExpr LT ShiftExpr
   68        | RelExpr LE ShiftExpr
   69        | RelExpr GT ShiftExpr
   70        | RelExpr GE ShiftExpr
   71        | ShiftExpr

   72 ShiftExpr: ShiftExpr LSHIFT AddExpr
   73          | ShiftExpr RSHIFT AddExpr
   74          | AddExpr

   75 AddExpr: AddExpr PLUS MulExpr
   76        | AddExpr MINUS MulExpr
   77        | MulExpr

   78 MulExpr: MulExpr STAR UnaryExpr
   79        | MulExpr DIV UnaryExpr
   80        | MulExpr MOD UnaryExpr
   81        | UnaryExpr

   82 UnaryExpr: MINUS UnaryExpr
   83          | NOT UnaryExpr
   84          | PLUS UnaryExpr
   85          | PostfixExpr

   86 PostfixExpr: IDENTIFIER DOTLENGTH
   87            | IDENTIFIER LPAR ArgListOpt RPAR
   88            | IDENTIFIER LPAR error RPAR
   89            | PARSEINT LPAR IDENTIFIER LSQ Expr RSQ RPAR
   90            | PARSEINT LPAR error RPAR
   91            | LPAR Expr RPAR
   92            | IDENTIFIER
   93            | NATURAL
   94            | DECIMAL
   95            | BOOLLIT

   96 ArgListOpt: ArgList
   97           | ε

   98 ArgList: Expr
   99        | ArgList COMMA Expr


